Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You have memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or more precisely, you have a split personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who don't know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's vital you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're unravelling this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we'll go at your own pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With hypnotherapy we've dived deep into your subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's slowly opening up your memories, your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The blackouts are fewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now I think we've reached a...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,problematic but important point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,During your visits you've used different names.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name right now?
